@page "/disks"
@using Stykker.Pairing
@* Die Laufwerke: statisch gerendert, die Zeilen holt disks.js im Sekundentakt aus /api/disks. Kein Wert steht als Zahl im
   Markup: fehlt eine Messung, zeigt die Seite „–" (nie eine erfundene Zahl). Die Seite zeigt nur, sie ändert nichts –
   Prozesse beendet man in der Prozessliste. *@

<div class="top">
    <div class="brand"><span class="logo">◆</span> STYKKER <span class="acc">SYS</span></div>
    <nav>
        <a href="/">Processes</a>
        <a class="active" href="/disks">Disks</a>
        <a href="http://127.0.0.1:@(StykkerPorts.Hub)/" title="StykkerHUD: CPU, memory, GPU, storage and network">Overview</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="strip">
        <span class="stat" title="Volumes with a drive letter">Drives <b id="v-drives">–</b></span>
        <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Theme">
            <button type="button" data-theme-choice="dark" class="on">Dark</button>
            <button type="button" data-theme-choice="titan">Titan</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<main>
    <div id="disk-notes"></div>

    <div class="sec">Drives<span class="right mono" id="v-disk-time">–</span></div>
    <div class="reqs disk-table" id="disk-volumes"></div>

    <div class="sec">Physical disks</div>
    <div class="reqs disk-table" id="disk-physical"></div>

    <div class="sec">Programs with the most disk traffic</div>
    <div class="reqs disk-table" id="disk-procs"></div>
    <p class="sys-note muted" style="font-size:var(--t-xs)">Read and write of a program count all its input and output, not only the disk. Refreshes every second while this page is open.</p>

    <div id="toast"></div>
</main>
